### Specific Dataset Attributions:
- **Payer Sanskrit Course Corpus (`payer_sanskrit.json`)**:
  Derived and synthesized from the Sanskrit course by Alois Payer and the canonical vocabulary glossary compiled by Simone Dünneisen (http://www.payer.de). Curated and structured for Alexis by Marco Demarmels / Birchville Scholarly Synthesis.
- **Hindi bolo! Vocabulary (`hindi_bolo.json`)**:
  Curated vocabulary dataset for modern standard Hindi. Birchville Scholarly Synthesis.
